# Vimium custom key mappings

## Scrolling
map j scrollDown
map k scrollUp
map h scrollLeft
map l scrollRight

map gg scrollToTop
map G scrollToBottom

## Links
map f LinkHints.activateMode
map F LinkHints.activateModeToOpenInNewTab

## Tabs
map J nextTab
map K previousTab
map x removeTab
map X restoreTab

## Navigation
map H goBack
map L goForward

## Search
map / enterFindMode
map n preformFind
map N preformBackwardsFind

